# Keeps .release-assets/ committable so worker/Dockerfile's
# `COPY .release-assets/` succeeds on a checkout that never ran
# scripts/fetch-release-assets.sh. The tarballs themselves are git-ignored
# cache material (fetched by that script, cached in CI keyed on
# hashFiles('worker/Dockerfile')) and every one of them must pass the
# Dockerfile's pinned sha256 before it is used.
